Q8t6Uw&oe=6AE20CDB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Zbonk_MallOfTheDead_CoverLandscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "949396751160801", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307444_949396754494134_8887719704836474069_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mjZ5vjYuSgoQ7kNvwEKBrSR&_nc_oc=AdqrMRof5A5GeRIM53cF9KZ0Y7OkkaK-QY6Chy9kd4w6IWo-LsYlHtXAKBXJ2OsQYvY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNHb0F9TLzwJ1O1nMP8JN98ikG-n30-wt9Uj9wuH0RT4A&oe=6AE21D61"}, "display_name": "ZOMBONK", "keywords": ["zombie", "gun", "shooting", "multiplayer", "monke"], "long_description": "# Bonker wake up. World gone. Whatever.\n\nZombies and monsters everywhere. Bonker still vibing. \ud83d\ude0e\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\n\nExplore maps, crack open boxes, hunt for gear, survive long enough to flex it.\n\nLoot stuff \u2192 Sell stuff \u2192 Get Bonk$ \u2192 Buy drip. \n\n# Multiple maps to choose from:\n- \ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f Bonktopia City - open, quiet, and NOT SAFE\n- \ud83e\udddf Zombie Survival - relentless waves, COD zombies vibes\n- \ud83c\udfeb School - three levels. too many footsteps.\n- \ud83d\udef0\ufe0f Space - out it the orbit, something broke into the station\n- \ud83d\udca3 War - they started it, you end it\n- \ud83d\udc1bNest - what lies underground will shock you\n- \ud83c\udffaTemple - explore the secrets of the civilizations before bonkers\n- \ud83c\udfaa Bonkland - horror carnival with dark rooms, laser pathways, & targets everywhere.\n- \ud83c\udd99 Skybonk - an Only Up inspired parkour map, with zombies of course\n\nPro Tip: Bonk with friends for more loot and more BONK$. \n\nPlay in private servers or chill in the Social Hub safe zone to hang with fellow Bonkers.\n\n**\ud83e\udd1d Come hang in discord, and meet our bonker community \ud83d\udc49 discord.gg/zombonkvr**\n", "short_description": "Survive the zombie apocalypse, loot for guns and items!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "